  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2607.07 Responsibility to Post Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2607.07 Responsibility to Post Information. Pursuant to RSA 160-C:10, any person engaged in selling permissible fireworks shall post in a conspicuous place on the sales premises a list, prepared by the commissioner, of the municipalities where the display or possession of permissible fireworks is prohibited and of all permissible fireworks that are authorized for retail sale.\n\nSource. #4983, eff 11-16-90; moved by #5752, eff 12-2-93 (formerly Saf-C 2602); ss by #6459, eff 2-20-97; ss by #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
